{"ts":"2026-05-17T05:49:50.840Z","author":"claude-code-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-8wwl"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm init footer + bundle calendar so cal/templates are discoverable"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Dogfood 2026-05-17: brand-new agents miss `pm cal`/`pm calendar` because the package is not bundled and `pm --help` lists nothing about installing it. Suggest: (a) print a 5-line next-steps footer at the end of `pm init` listing core invocations and the single-command install for calendar/templates/guide-shell, (b) ship calendar in the default install (it is already the de-facto path for context.agenda) so `pm cal` works out of the box.\n\nAcceptance: pm init prints the footer; calendar command works in a fresh tracker without explicit install; tests assert both."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","bootstrap","calendar","init","pm-cli"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-05-17T05:49:50.840Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-05-17T05:49:50.840Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-05-24T05:49:50.840Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-code-agent"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"26c77c41de458a7a107a07f4187ae9d77228b3be6fb90f1020951a8255333ac9","message":""}
